<title>JAPAN: Geostr - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Geostr - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.81		vs	   12.64</p>
<p> Operating	  901    million	  vs	  982    million</p>
<p> Current	    644    million	  vs	  543    million</p>
<p> Net		  355    million	  vs	  275    million</p>
<p> EPS		   20.33 yen	  vs	   17.05 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     18 million	  vs	  16 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Geostr Corp is a maker of concrete products.</p>
<p>The company adopted a new accounting method in the</p>
<p>half-year period to September 30, 1996. The year-ago</p>
<p>figures above were based on the new accounting method</p>
<p>and so they are different from interim earnings figures</p>
<p>the company announced last year.</p>
</text>
